{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/545415-lfg-beast-on-rollz-org","id":545415,"title":"[LFG] Beast on Rollz.org","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-08T09:50:33-07:00","id":545415,"title":"[LFG] Beast on Rollz.org","content":"With the book coming out in a few months, I'm throwing my hat into the ring and volunteering to run a Beast Chat game, on Rolz.com. I'll be posting house rules (simple, mostly regarding template interactions and dealing with crossover in a focused game) as soon as I have them hammered out.<br /> <br /> The Chronicle will focus on growing into power, traveling, and how the Begotten interact with various Supernatural power blocs. Ideally, we'll also get to the point where we can talk about endgames, both for the players and for their potential allies.<br /> <br /> Send me your ideas!<br /> <br /> EDIT: the room we will be holding the game in is here: <a href=\"https://rolz.org/dr?room=The%20Monster&amp;#39;s%20Ball\" target=\"_blank\">The Monster's Ball</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":1959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","user":"Hexmeister Vic","date":". 06-08-2015, 03:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T10:41:16-07:00","id":545521,"title":"","content":"Whats the length of the chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T11:03:22-07:00","id":545541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/545415-lfg-beast-on-rollz-org?p=545521#post545521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Whats the length of the chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ideally 6 months to a year, depending upon how often we can run sessions. I'd like to run at least 1 4-6 hour session a week, but I'm flexible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T12:50:04-07:00","id":545664,"title":"","content":"I'm interested! Did you want to talk about ideas in the chat room or in this thread? I'm trying to create a Beast that embodies the fear of knowledge - specifically knowledge that there is no truth or true existence - inspired by modern science.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5697-n_a_anyon","name":"n_a_anyon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T13:26:47-07:00","id":545720,"title":"","content":"Tentatively interested. Depends on what happens between then and now and what options are open.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T14:20:05-07:00","id":545779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>n_a_anyon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/545415-lfg-beast-on-rollz-org?p=545664#post545664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm interested! Did you want to talk about ideas in the chat room or in this thread? I'm trying to create a Beast that embodies the fear of knowledge - specifically knowledge that there is no truth or true existence - inspired by modern science.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds good. I definitely want to discuss people's ideas here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T09:51:26-07:00","id":547184,"title":"","content":"Here's what I have so far: <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Erwin</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Eshmaki Ravager</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Erwin dreamed of things that did not make sense, couldn\u2019t logically exist let alone be visualized, and yet he saw them anyway. Shapes whose angles didn\u2019t add up properly, blackness filled with color, timeless and frozen landscapes changing nonetheless. Erwin saw the world as it really was. Which is to say, as it was not, because the world is not. Or at least it might not. In his dreams, the fa\u00e7ade of reality seemed to fade away, and the utter lack-of-truth to existence was laid bare. A sparking and crackling void, creating everything from nothing.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In these dreams Erwin would be almost swallowed and annihilated by these untruths. As they began, as he first saw these non-Euclidean geometries and counter-factual histories taking shape, the fear of this coming destruction gripped his Soul. But it was always inevitable. However, this ending never happened, and Erwin always awoke just before this realization of the world\u2019s nonexistence consumed him along with the rest of reality.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">He grew up among other intelligent humans, people who saw the myths and traditions of the past for the fallacies they were, but even the brightest of them he failed to connect with. He felt their emotions, cheered for the same athletic teams and political causes as them, but still saw that there was simultaneously more and less to existence than they were willing to be, or capable of, seeing. He moved between different social groups, enjoying the company of many different people, but never quite fitting in or feeling totally accepted.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5697-n_a_anyon","name":"n_a_anyon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T10:17:50-07:00","id":547256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>n_a_anyon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/545415-lfg-beast-on-rollz-org?p=547184#post547184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's what I have so far: <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Erwin</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Eshmaki Ravager</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Erwin dreamed of things that did not make sense, couldn\u2019t logically exist let alone be visualized, and yet he saw them anyway. Shapes whose angles didn\u2019t add up properly, blackness filled with color, timeless and frozen landscapes changing nonetheless. Erwin saw the world as it really was. Which is to say, as it was not, because the world is not. Or at least it might not. In his dreams, the fa\u00e7ade of reality seemed to fade away, and the utter lack-of-truth to existence was laid bare. A sparking and crackling void, creating everything from nothing.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">In these dreams Erwin would be almost swallowed and annihilated by these untruths. As they began, as he first saw these non-Euclidean geometries and counter-factual histories taking shape, the fear of this coming destruction gripped his Soul. But it was always inevitable. However, this ending never happened, and Erwin always awoke just before this realization of the world\u2019s nonexistence consumed him along with the rest of reality.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">He grew up among other intelligent humans, people who saw the myths and traditions of the past for the fallacies they were, but even the brightest of them he failed to connect with. He felt their emotions, cheered for the same athletic teams and political causes as them, but still saw that there was simultaneously more and less to existence than they were willing to be, or capable of, seeing. He moved between different social groups, enjoying the company of many different people, but never quite fitting in or feeling totally accepted.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>This guy needs a Mage or Sin-Eater to pal around with. Good concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T08:53:51-07:00","id":555748,"title":"","content":"Wel